{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The [Eb]law was weak within the flesh
God sent his own [Gm]Son to set us free
In the [Eb]likeness of sinful nature
He offered up the sac[Gm]rifice
So the [Eb]righteous requirement would be met
In us who [Gm]walk by the Spirit now
Not by the de[Eb]sires of the body
[F]But by the breath of the [Bb]Holy One
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The mind set on the Spir[Eb]it is life and [F]peace
A gentle hope that no [Gm7]darkness can e[Bb/D]rase
