A quiet joy for the [Gm7]weary soul to re[Eb]lease
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Those who live according to the flesh
Set their minds on [Gm7]what the body wants
[Eb]But those who live in the Spirit
Set their minds on what the Spirit [Bb]brings
[Eb]Hostile thoughts cannot submit to God
They [Gm7]cannot follow his holy law
[Eb]Those who stay in the [F]flesh
Cannot please the [Bb]Lord in any way
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Cm7]But you are not in the flesh to[F]day
The [Gm]Spirit of Christ dwells in [Eb]you
If [Cm7]you have not the Spirit of [F]Christ
You do [Gm]not belong to him at [Eb]all
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
